id=a20e-stability
name=a20e Stability (stay awake, no doze)
version=1.1
versionCode=2
author=tay737
description=Keeps the display awake and stops doze/suspend on the Galaxy A20e, because resuming from display-off wedges system_server on this kernel. Relaxes boot timeouts and re-applies the NetHunter chroot dbus fix at every boot.
